        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Climb! NYARUMA Action Puzzle”</i> is a unique blend of <strong>falling-block puzzle and character action</strong> gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the irresistibly cute creature “Nyaruma” by stacking falling blocks, escaping rising lava, and reaching the goal!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fresh Twist on Falling-Block Puzzles</strong><br>　Line up blocks to slow down the lava and create a platform to guide &quot;Nyaruma&quot;. <br>　Collect items along the way to power up and open new strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Fun to Master</strong><br>　Simple controls with a built-in tutorial make it accessible for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>　The challenge never ends — the difficulty rises with every clear!<br>　Compete with players around the world on the <strong>global rankings</strong>,<br>　and track your own score history to see how far you’ve come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized for PC</strong><br>　The original mobile vertical gameplay has been redesigned for widescreen.<br>　Enjoy smooth controls with keyboard, mouse, or gamepad support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nyaruma on this charming and addictive puzzle adventure, and see how high your score can climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Streaming &amp; Content Creation Policy[/color]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos, livestreams, and other related content are welcome.<br>Monetization is allowed for both individuals and organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is required.<br>Including a link to the Steam store page in your description is appreciated.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Climb! NYARUMA Action Puzzle”</i> is a unique blend of <strong>falling-block puzzle and character action</strong> gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the irresistibly cute creature “Nyaruma” by stacking falling blocks, escaping rising lava, and reaching the goal!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fresh Twist on Falling-Block Puzzles</strong><br>　Line up blocks to slow down the lava and create a platform to guide &quot;Nyaruma&quot;. <br>　Collect items along the way to power up and open new strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Fun to Master</strong><br>　Simple controls with a built-in tutorial make it accessible for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>　The challenge never ends — the difficulty rises with every clear!<br>　Compete with players around the world on the <strong>global rankings</strong>,<br>　and track your own score history to see how far you’ve come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized for PC</strong><br>　The original mobile vertical gameplay has been redesigned for widescreen.<br>　Enjoy smooth controls with keyboard, mouse, or gamepad support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Nyaruma on this charming and addictive puzzle adventure, and see how high your score can climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Streaming &amp; Content Creation Policy[/color]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos, livestreams, and other related content are welcome.<br>Monetization is allowed for both individuals and organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is required.<br>Including a link to the Steam store page in your description is appreciated.</p>",
        "short_description": "Cuteness overload! The quirky falling-block action puzzle is now on Steam! Stack blocks and guide the adorable “Nyarumar” to the goal!",
